  "text": "Skip to content\nSearch\nK\nMain Navigation\nHomepage\nAPI Playground\nForum\n10.2.0-SNAPSHOT (latest)\nSidebar Navigation\nHome - v10.2.0-SNAPSHOT\n\nGetting Started\n\nAPI Reference\nRun ORS instance\nContributing\nTechnical details\n\nFAQ\n\nHosted API Restrictions\n\nOn this page\nDirections restrictions\nIsochrones restrictions\nMatrix restrictions\nSnap restrictions\nExport restrictions\nPOIs restrictions\nElevation restrictions\nOptimization restrictions\nHosted API Restrictions\n​\n\nTo provide services for thousands of users we have to restrict queries in our API to ensure our services stay stable for everyone. When you are using our API the following restrictions apply to the respective endpoints. If you want to make queries beyond these limits you should look into setting up your own customized openrouteservice backend.\n\nDirections restrictions\n​\nModes\tMaximum distance\tMaximum distance with profile restrictions\nFoot profiles\t6.000 km\t6,000 km\nCycling profiles\t6.000 km\t6.000 km\nDriving profiles\t6.000 km\t6.000 km\nWheelchair profile\t6.000 km\t300 km\nOption\tMaximum\nDistance (with avoid areas)\t150 km\nDistance (alternative & round trip)\t100 km\nAlternative route count\t3\nAvoid polygon area\t200 km²\nAvoid polygon extent (height or width)\t20 km\nRoute waypoints\t50\nIsochrones restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nLocations\t5\nIntervals\t10\nRange distance\t120 km\nRange time (Foot profiles)\t20 h\nRange time (Cycling profiles)\t5 h\nRange time (Driving profiles)\t1 h\nMatrix restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nLocations (origin x destination)\t3.500 (e.g. 50 x 50) per request\nLocations (with dynamic arguments)\t25 (e.g. 5 x 5) per request\nSnap restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nLocations\t5.000 per request\nExport restrictions\n​\nOption\tStandard Plan\tCollaborative Plan\nMaximum bbox area\t10km²\t50km²\nPOIs restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nMaximum Area\t50 km²\nMaximum Linestring length\t500 km\nMaximum search radius\t2 km\nElevation restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nVertex amount\t2000\nOptimization restrictions\n​\nOption\tMaximum\nRoutes\t50\nVehicles\t3\nSuggest an improvement\n\nUpdated at: Nov 6, 2026, 7:15 PM\n\nPager\nPrevious page\nFAQ",
  "title": "Hosted API Restrictions | openrouteservice backend documentation",
  "url": "https://giscience.github.io/openrouteservice/hosted-api-restrictions"
